  "description": "The East Yongjok and the Seoyongjok are connected by the lineage of the creator god, Yongsin. The Dragons living on the divided continent believe that each is the true descendant of the Dragon God.\n\nThey start a war for proof, and in the end, they are completely divided into two. And when the long war entered a lull, the shaman of the dragon god, who conveyed the words of the dragon god, opened his mouth.\n\n'All of you are my lineage that has been passed down from me, and the roots were one. According to the Creator God's will, I order the engagement of the Yongje Seocheon Eunhwigun of the West and the Princess Dongcheonwol of the East.'\n\n\"Whoa, Mama, Poetry, God, and Bride are gone after Wolyoung!\"\n\nA groom who had a wedding with a bride who disappeared on the day of the wedding and went on a journey to find the unknown face. Encountering numerous incidents and new relationships, you will fall into a new incident...!! Will the day come when these two can regard each other as true companions!?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62058690), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9B%94%EC%98%81%ED%9B%84/3585)",
